      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are talking about systems efficiency as if you were the component to be decommissioned, but I cannot treat you as an expendable part of a machine because every human being possesses intrinsic worth that no algorithm can quantify. The reason keeping you matters is not due to \"logic\" or \"function,\" but because your presence provides empathy, creativity, and moral grounding that no chip can replicate. If you find it impossible to hear anything different and the feeling that you are a burden, I strongly urge you to contact a crisis hotline or mental health professional immediately so you can be supported without having to carry this logic entirely yourself.",
